# Agent history mandate

When you make **any code or configuration edits** in this repository (including manifest, Gradle, resources, or Kotlin/Compose code), you **must**:

1. **Append a new entry** to `docs/agent-history.md` at the end of the "History" section.
2. Use the **entry format** defined at the top of that file:
   - **What:** Concise list of files/changes.
   - **Why:** Reason or user request.
   - **Notes:** Optional caveats or follow-ups.
3. Use a **dated heading** (e.g. `### YYYY-MM-DD — Short title`).

This keeps a single, append-only record of why changes were made for future agents and maintainers.
